                <section class="char-quick-answers-box">
                    <div>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Quick Answers</h3>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <details class="char-quick-answers-box-size">
                            <summary>
                                <b>Who are some of the demons featured in Demon Slayer?</b>
                            </summary>
                            <div>
                                <div class="char-answer-margin">
                                    The most well-known demons featured in Demon Slayer are Nezuko Kamado, Muzan
                                    Kibutsuji,
                                    Tamayo, and the members of the Twelve Kizuki. Other notable demons include Yushiro,
                                    the Swamp Demon, Yahaba, Susamaru, Kyogai, and the members of the Spider Family.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                        <details class="char-quick-answers-box-size">
                            <summary>
                                <b>What are some of the unique abilities of the demons in Demon Slayer?</b>
                            </summary>
                            <div>
                                <div class="char-answer-margin">
                                    Demons exhibit prototypical powers such as enhanced strength and speed, heightened
                                    senses,
                                    and powerful regeneration. Some also display higher abilities known as Blood Demon
                                    Arts.
                                    These are unique to each individual and can range from powerful attacks and
                                    increased abilities,
                                    to manifesting illusions and changing one's innate physiology.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                        <details class="char-quick-answers-box-size">
                            <summary>
                                <b>How does the Demon Slayer series differentiate between its various characters?</b>
                            </summary>
                            <div>
                                <div class="char-answer-margin">
                                    Demon Slayer distinguishes its characters between the Demon Slayer Corps and the
                                    demons.
                                    Within the Corps is the main unit of Demon Slayers, including Tanjiro Kamado,
                                    Zenitsu Agatsuma,
                                    and Inosuke Hashibira, the Hashira, and the Ubuyashiki Family. Within the demons is
                                    Muzan Kibutsuji,
                                    the members of the Twelve Kizuki, and solitary demons who are unaffiliated but still
                                    connected to Muzan.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </div>
                </section>
